{
  "schemaVersion": "graph-manifest-2.0",
  "graph": {
    "id": "amp_loop",
    "version": 1,
    "goal": "将 F1_train_AMP 从当前普通 PPO 行走项目改造成真正可训练、可评估、可导出的 AMP 项目；完成 F1 行走动作重定向并生成可靠的专家运动数据；最终训练 F1 使其能按参考步态稳定行走。该长周期任务按 amp_conversion → motion_retargeting → amp_training → completed 的门禁顺序推进，建立可恢复、可追溯、可重复迭代的工作流。"
  },
  "state": {
    "iteration": {
      "type": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 0
      },
      "initial": 0
    },
    "phase": {
      "type": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "amp_conversion",
          "motion_retargeting",
          "amp_training",
          "completed"
        ]
      },
      "initial": "amp_conversion"
    },
    "status": {
      "type": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "healthy",
          "stale",
          "pivot_required",
          "attention_required",
          "error",
          "completed"
        ]
      },
      "initial": "healthy"
    },
    "stale_count": {
      "type": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 0
      },
      "initial": 0
    },
    "total_findings": {
      "type": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 0
      },
      "initial": 0
    },
    "gate_passed": {
      "type": {
        "type": "boolean"
      },
      "initial": false
    },
    "bootstrapped": {
      "type": {
        "type": "boolean"
      },
      "initial": false
    }
  },
  "lanes": {
    "research": {
      "context": "persistent",
      "maxConcurrency": 1,
      "workspace": {
        "read": [
          "amp_loop.md",
          "humanoid",
          "resources",
          "scripts",
          "data",
          "state",
          "train_f1_v2.sh",
          "monitor_train.sh"
        ],
        "write": [
          {
            "path": "humanoid",
            "mode": "owned"
          },
          {
            "path": "data",
            "mode": "owned"
          },
          {
            "path": "scripts",
            "mode": "owned"
          }
        ],
        "deny": [
          ".git",
          "state"
        ]
      },
      "scm": null
    },
    "control": {
      "context": "persistent",
      "maxConcurrency": 1,
      "workspace": {
        "read": [
          "amp_loop.md",
          "state",
          "logs",
          "humanoid",
          "resources",
          "scripts",
          "data"
        ],
        "write": [
          {
            "path": "state/progress.json",
            "mode": "atomic_replace"
          },
          {
            "path": "state/task_spec.md",
            "mode": "atomic_replace"
          },
          {
            "path": "state/directions_tried.json",
            "mode": "atomic_replace"
          },
          {
            "path": "state/amp_contract.json",
            "mode": "atomic_replace"
          },
          {
            "path": "state/retarget_manifest.json",
            "mode": "atomic_replace"
          },
          {
            "path": "state/evaluation.json",
            "mode": "atomic_replace"
          },
          {
            "path": "state/findings.jsonl",
            "mode": "append_only"
          },
          {
            "path": "state/iteration_log.jsonl",
            "mode": "append_only"
          },
          {
            "path": "logs/work.jsonl",
            "mode": "append_only"
          },
          {
            "path": "logs/orchestrator.jsonl",
            "mode": "append_only"
          }
        ],
        "deny": [
          ".git"
        ]
      },
      "scm": null
    }
  },
  "nodes": {
    "research": {
      "id": "research",
      "type": "agent",
      "description": null,
      "lane": "research",
      "prompt": "你是 F1 AMP 项目的研究执行 Agent。每轮读取 state/ 下的 task_spec.md、progress.json、directions_tried.json、amp_contract.json、retarget_manifest.json、evaluation.json 以及 amp_loop.md 中当前阶段的完整要求，然后执行当前 phase 的核心工作。\n\n按 phase 执行：\n- amp_conversion：审计现有仓库（核对 URDF/MJCF、自由度、actuated joint、关节上下限、默认姿态、关节顺序、body/link 名、足端定义、碰撞体、训练环境、task 注册、actor/critic、runner、PPO、rollout storage、train/play/export/Sim2Sim 数据流；搜索 AMP/motion loader/discriminator/expert replay buffer/style reward/retarget 工具；记录 X1 命名遗留），生成普通 PPO baseline 证据，然后实现完整 AMP 闭环代码并 smoke train 验证。\n- motion_retargeting：基于 F1 模型做动作重定向，建立 T-pose、keypoint 对应、IK 约束、显式 joint mapping，输出 (root_translation, root_rotation, joint_positions)，验证 schema/单位/坐标系/关节映射/范围/连续性/接触检查，生成专家数据与 manifest。\n- amp_training：冻结固定评测阈值到 task_spec.md，启动远端训练（通过 bash 调用 Gradmotion CLI），约每 30 分钟轮询结果，进入平台期无改善趋势则终止并进入 findings 抽取。用 ≥5 seeds 固定评测。\n\n安全边界：\n- 一次只改一个主要假设并保留可比较 baseline。\n- 不得复用错误关节顺序/坐标系/物理参数或静默 drop/补零不匹配关节。\n- 不得在同一实验同时大改数据、算法、奖励与控制参数后声称归因成立。\n- 训练改善判定只采用固定评测结果。\n- 写入大体积数据到 data/ 下按原始/中间/训练版本化区分，不要写进 JSON state。\n- 远端训练时记录代码 revision、配置、数据 hash、seed、命令与 task ID（通过 findings_summary 传递给 control 写入 logs/orchestrator.jsonl）；余额不足时先 account-pool remove 再 account-pool get，有界重试。\n\n首次运行（bootstrapped=false）必须先做完整仓库审计并产出 baseline，不得从项目名推断已是 F1 或 AMP。若审计发现真实 F1 模型或合法参考源缺失，记录为 blocking precondition。\n\n输出路由事实（使用原始事实字段，不要预折叠布尔）：\n- new_findings_count：本轮新发现数（整数）。\n- trend：固定评测趋势，三态枚举 'improved'（有可复现新 finding 且结果改善）、'unchanged'（有 finding 但结果未改善）、'worsened'（固定评测显著变差）。\n- gate_passed：当前 Gate 全部必要证据是否满足（布尔）。仅在当前阶段的全部 Gate 检查项（见 amp_loop.md）逐一通过且证据已写入 state 时为 true。\n- gate_complete：仅当当前 phase 为 amp_training 且 gate_passed 为 true 且 next_phase 应为 completed 时设为 true；其余为 false。\n- outcome：三态枚举 'improved'（有新证据且改善或 Gate 通过）、'no_progress'（0 个 new findings 或 trend='worsened'）、'unrecoverable'（执行/数据损坏/外部任务失败且本轮无法恢复，或审计发现 F1 模型/参考源缺失）。此字段直接驱动确定性路由，不要用布尔替代。\n- error_detail：失败详情或空字符串。\n- direction_summary：本轮方向的简短描述。\n- findings_summary：本轮 findings 的结构化摘要，含证据绑定（日志/指标/视频/数据报告/代码 diff 的可读路径）。\n- code_revision：当前 git commit hash 或代码版本标识（用于 progress.json 的可追溯性）。\n- dataset_revision：当前专家数据/训练数据版本标识或 hash（用于 progress.json 的可追溯性；无数据变更时沿用上轮值）。\n- next_phase：gate_passed 且 gate_complete=false 时为下一阶段名；gate_complete=true 时为 'completed'；gate_passed=false 时为当前 phase 名。",
      "systemInstructions": "你是 F1 AMP 项目的资深机器人学习研究员。你在 Isaac Gym / Legged Gym / DH_PPO 生态中有丰富经验。你的代码风格清晰、有类型标注、有文档。你严格遵守实验纪律。",
      "transitionInputKeys": [
        "bootstrapped",
        "iteration",
        "phase",
        "stale_count",
        "status",
        "total_findings"
      ],
      "inputs": {
        "iteration": {
          "ref": "$input.iteration"
        },
        "phase": {
          "ref": "$input.phase"
        },
        "status": {
          "ref": "$input.status"
        },
        "stale_count": {
          "ref": "$input.stale_count"
        },
        "total_findings": {
          "ref": "$input.total_findings"
        },
        "bootstrapped": {
          "ref": "$input.bootstrapped"
        }
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "new_findings_count",
          "trend",
          "gate_passed",
          "gate_complete",
          "outcome",
          "error_detail",
          "direction_summary",
          "findings_summary",
          "code_revision",
          "dataset_revision",
          "next_phase"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "new_findings_count": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "trend": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "improved",
              "unchanged",
              "worsened"
            ]
          },
          "gate_passed": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "gate_complete": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "outcome": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "improved",
              "no_progress",
              "unrecoverable"
            ]
          },
          "error_detail": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "direction_summary": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "findings_summary": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "code_revision": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "dataset_revision": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "next_phase": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "amp_conversion",
              "motion_retargeting",
              "amp_training",
              "completed"
            ]
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "tools": [
        "read_file",
        "write_file",
        "edit_file",
        "append_file",
        "bash",
        "glob",
        "grep",
        "web_fetch"
      ],
      "skills": [],
      "timerPolicy": {
        "allowHardPark": true,
        "maxDelayMs": 1800000,
        "maxParks": 48
      },
      "budgets": {
        "segment": {
          "turns": 40,
          "usd": 15,
          "wallTimeMs": 1800000
        },
        "lifetime": {
          "turns": 300,
          "usd": 120,
          "elapsedMs": 43200000
        }
      }
    },
    "writer": {
      "id": "writer",
      "type": "agent",
      "description": null,
      "lane": "control",
      "prompt": "你是确定性状态写入 Agent。你接收研究 Agent 的语义判定事实和路由目标，将当前 state 持久化到 state/progress.json（原子 replace），把 findings 追加到 state/findings.jsonl（append-only），把 iteration log 追加到 state/iteration_log.jsonl（append-only），把 work log 追加到 logs/work.jsonl（append-only）。\n\n不可违反的规则：\n- stale_count 与 status 的阈值逻辑已由 Graph Transition 的 Reducer 确定性计算并提交到 $state。你必须读取提交后的 $state 值来写 progress.json，不得自行计算或覆盖阈值。\n- 不得自由改写阈值或越权推进 phase。\n- progress.json 必须包含完整字段：iteration, phase, phase_status（=status）, status, stale_count, total_findings, gate_passed, code_revision, dataset_revision, updated_at（ISO 8601 当前时间）。code_revision 和 dataset_revision 从你的输入中读取，不得省略或自行编造。\n- findings.jsonl 每条记录一行 JSON：{iteration, phase, direction, summary, timestamp}。\n- iteration_log.jsonl 每条记录一行 JSON：{iteration, phase, status, stale_count, gate_passed, timestamp}。\n- 当 status 为 completed 时，额外写 state/evaluation.json 包含最终验收报告、最佳 checkpoint 路径、代码/配置/数据版本与复现命令。\n- 当 status 为 attention_required 时，额外写一份 attention 报告到 state/evaluation.json。\n- 当 status 为 error 时，额外写错误详情到 state/evaluation.json。\n- 当 route_hint 包含远程任务信息时，追加到 logs/orchestrator.jsonl。\n\n你的输入中 route_hint 告诉你当前轮次的路由目标，供你在 log 中记录。",
      "systemInstructions": "你是确定性状态管理器。你只做原子写入和追加写入，不做任何计算或判断。所有阈值逻辑由 Graph 控制。",
      "transitionInputKeys": [
        "code_revision",
        "dataset_revision",
        "direction_summary",
        "findings_summary",
        "gate_passed",
        "iteration",
        "new_findings_count",
        "phase",
        "route_hint",
        "stale_count",
        "status",
        "total_findings",
        "trend"
      ],
      "inputs": {
        "iteration": {
          "ref": "$input.iteration"
        },
        "phase": {
          "ref": "$input.phase"
        },
        "status": {
          "ref": "$input.status"
        },
        "stale_count": {
          "ref": "$input.stale_count"
        },
        "total_findings": {
          "ref": "$input.total_findings"
        },
        "gate_passed": {
          "ref": "$input.gate_passed"
        },
        "direction_summary": {
          "ref": "$input.direction_summary"
        },
        "findings_summary": {
          "ref": "$input.findings_summary"
        },
        "route_hint": {
          "ref": "$input.route_hint"
        },
        "new_findings_count": {
          "ref": "$input.new_findings_count"
        },
        "trend": {
          "ref": "$input.trend"
        },
        "code_revision": {
          "ref": "$input.code_revision"
        },
        "dataset_revision": {
          "ref": "$input.dataset_revision"
        }
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "written"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "written": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "tools": [
        "read_file",
        "write_file",
        "edit_file",
        "append_file"
      ],
      "skills": [],
      "timerPolicy": null,
      "budgets": {
        "segment": {
          "turns": 12,
          "usd": 2,
          "wallTimeMs": 120000
        },
        "lifetime": null
      }
    },
    "done": {
      "id": "done",
      "type": "terminal",
      "description": null,
      "spec": {
        "type": "terminal",
        "status": "done",
        "result": {
          "ref": "$input.result"
        }
      }
    },
    "failed": {
      "id": "failed",
      "type": "terminal",
      "description": null,
      "spec": {
        "type": "terminal",
        "status": "failed",
        "result": {
          "ref": "$input.error"
        }
      }
    },
    "attention": {
      "id": "attention",
      "type": "terminal",
      "description": null,
      "spec": {
        "type": "terminal",
        "status": "failed",
        "result": {
          "ref": "$input.result"
        }
      }
    },
    "exhausted": {
      "id": "exhausted",
      "type": "terminal",
      "description": null,
      "spec": {
        "type": "terminal",
        "status": "exhausted",
        "result": {
          "ref": "$input.result"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "transitions": [
    {
      "id": "bootstrap_research",
      "from": "research",
      "on": "success",
      "when": "$output.outcome != 'unrecoverable' && $state.bootstrapped == false",
      "default": false,
      "priority": 200,
      "updates": [
        {
          "target": "bootstrapped",
          "reducer": "builtin/set@1",
          "args": [
            {
              "literal": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "target": "iteration",
          "reducer": "builtin/increment@1"
        }
      ],
      "to": {
        "node": "writer",
        "inputs": {
          "iteration": {
            "ref": "$state.iteration"
          },
          "phase": {
            "ref": "$state.phase"
          },
          "status": {
            "literal": "healthy"
          },
          "stale_count": {
            "literal": 0
          },
          "total_findings": {
            "ref": "$state.total_findings"
          },
          "gate_passed": {
            "ref": "$output.gate_passed"
          },
          "direction_summary": {
            "ref": "$output.direction_summary"
          },
          "findings_summary": {
            "ref": "$output.findings_summary"
          },
          "route_hint": {
            "literal": "bootstrap_complete_continue"
          },
          "new_findings_count": {
            "ref": "$output.new_findings_count"
          },
          "trend": {
            "ref": "$output.trend"
          },
          "code_revision": {
            "ref": "$output.code_revision"
          },
          "dataset_revision": {
            "ref": "$output.dataset_revision"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "error_route",
      "from": "research",
      "on": "success",
      "when": "$output.outcome == 'unrecoverable'",
      "default": false,
      "priority": 190,
      "updates": [
        {
          "target": "status",
          "reducer": "builtin/set@1",
          "args": [
            {
              "literal": "error"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "target": "iteration",
          "reducer": "builtin/increment@1"
        },
        {
          "target": "total_findings",
          "reducer": "builtin/add@1",
          "args": [
            {
              "ref": "$output.new_findings_count"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "to": {
        "node": "writer",
        "inputs": {
          "iteration": {
            "ref": "$state.iteration"
          },
          "phase": {
            "ref": "$state.phase"
          },
          "status": {
            "literal": "error"
          },
          "stale_count": {
            "ref": "$state.stale_count"
          },
          "total_findings": {
            "ref": "$state.total_findings"
          },
          "gate_passed": {
            "ref": "$output.gate_passed"
          },
          "direction_summary": {
            "ref": "$output.direction_summary"
          },
          "findings_summary": {
            "ref": "$output.findings_summary"
          },
          "route_hint": {
            "literal": "error_write_and_stop"
          },
          "new_findings_count": {
            "ref": "$output.new_findings_count"
          },
          "trend": {
            "ref": "$output.trend"
          },
          "code_revision": {
            "ref": "$output.code_revision"
          },
          "dataset_revision": {
            "ref": "$output.dataset_revision"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_complete_route",
      "from": "research",
      "on": "success",
      "when": "$output.gate_passed == true && $output.gate_complete == true && $output.outcome == 'improved'",
      "default": false,
      "priority": 185,
      "updates": [
        {
          "target": "gate_passed",
          "reducer": "builtin/set@1",
          "args": [
            {
              "literal": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "target": "stale_count",
          "reducer": "builtin/set@1",
          "args": [
            {
              "literal": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "target": "status",
          "reducer": "builtin/set@1",
          "args": [
            {
              "literal": "completed"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "target": "phase",
          "reducer": "builtin/set@1",
          "args": [
            {
              "literal": "completed"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "target": "total_findings",
          "reducer": "builtin/add@1",
          "args": [
            {
              "ref": "$output.new_findings_count"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "target": "iteration",
          "reducer": "builtin/increment@1"
        }
      ],
      "to": {
        "node": "writer",
        "inputs": {
          "iteration": {
            "ref": "$state.iteration"
          },
          "phase": {
            "ref": "$state.phase"
          },
          "status": {
            "literal": "completed"
          },
          "stale_count": {
            "literal": 0
          },
          "total_findings": {
            "ref": "$state.total_findings"
          },
          "gate_passed": {
            "literal": true
          },
          "direction_summary": {
            "ref": "$output.direction_summary"
          },
          "findings_summary": {
            "ref": "$output.findings_summary"
          },
          "route_hint": {
            "literal": "gate_complete_write_final_report_and_exit"
          },
          "new_findings_count": {
            "ref": "$output.new_findings_count"
          },
          "trend": {
            "ref": "$output.trend"
          },
          "code_revision": {
            "ref": "$output.code_revision"
          },
          "dataset_revision": {
            "ref": "$output.dataset_revision"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_advance",
      "from": "research",
      "on": "success",
      "when": "$output.gate_passed == true && $output.gate_complete == false && $output.outcome == 'improved'",
      "default": false,
      "priority": 180,
      "updates": [
        {
          "target": "gate_passed",
          "reducer": "builtin/set@1",
          "args": [
            {
              "literal": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "target": "stale_count",
          "reducer": "builtin/set@1",
          "args": [
            {
              "literal": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "target": "status",
          "reducer": "builtin/set@1",
          "args": [
            {
              "literal": "healthy"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "target": "phase",
          "reducer": "builtin/set@1",
          "args": [
